#~ msgid ""
#~ "Verifying that a file you downloaded or received is actually the one you "
#~ "were expecting is often overlooked or too time-consuming to do. At the "
#~ "same time, it has become very easy to get your hands on a file that has "
#~ "been tampered with, due to the mass increase of malicious webpages and "
#~ "other actors."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Potvrđivanje da se pri preuzetoj ili primljenoj datoteci doista radi o "
#~ "očekivanoj datoteci često se zanemaruje ili oduzima previše vremena. "
#~ "Istovremeno je postalo sve jednostavnije manipulirati datoteke zbog "
#~ "masovnog povećanja zlonamjernih web-stranica i drugih aktera."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "This tool aims to solve that. Collision comes with a simple &amp; clean "
#~ "UI, allowing anyone, from any age and experience group, to generate, "
#~ "compare and verify MD5, SHA-256, SHA-512, SHA-1, Blake3, CRC32 and "
#~ "Adler32 hashes."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Cilj ovog alata je rješavanje tog problema. Collision pruža jednostavno "
#~ "korisničko sučelje te omogućuje svakome bilo koje dobi i iskustva, "
#~ "generirati, usporediti i potvrditi MD5, SHA-256, SHA-512, SHA-1, Blake3, "
#~ "CRC32 i Adler32 hasheve."

#~ msgid "Check Hashes"
